   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adriatic Sea Partenariat</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Adriatic Sea Partenariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den kroatiska regeringen har bett om Sidast&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r experthj&#xe4;lp av planderingen av Adriatic Sea Partenariat. Ett Partenariat &#xe4;r en m&#xf6;tesplats f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5;- och medelstora f&#xf6;retag, det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r under tv&#xe5; dagar och f&#xf6;retag fr&#xe5;n 35 olika l&#xe4;nder bjuds in. &#xd6;stsvenska handelskammaren har kontrakterats f&#xf6;r att bist&#xe5; Kroatien med detta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Croatian Gover. has applied to Sida for financing of two experts for the planning of the Adriatic Sea Partenariat-2002,which is a meeting place for small and medium sized enterprises. It takes place during two days and SMEs from 35 different countries get a chance to meet and establish crossborder contacts.The Chamber of Commerce of East Sweden&quot; has been assigned for the expert contribution.</narrative>
  </description>
